# (INVASION_WINDOW), or a fully-owned front-line hex whose 30-min casualty rate
# is above HOT_FLOOR and either over HOT_RATE outright or REL_MULT x the median
# active hex (so "clearly the main push" trips it even in a quiet war). Once
# both factions hold a base in the hex it reads as 'contested' (⚔) instead.
